278
00:13:06.307 --> 00:13:07.182
How to know:

279
00:13:07.462 --> 00:13:09.745
Retry policy times failure rate.

280
00:13:11.095 --> 00:13:11.841
Warning:

281
00:13:12.121 --> 00:13:14.148
Peaks are measured over the wrong window.

282
00:13:14.428 --> 00:13:19.804
A dashboard with 5-minute averages hides a 30-second spike that is 3 times higher.

283
00:13:20.084 --> 00:13:23.604
Size for the per-second peak your autoscaler can't absorb.

284
00:13:23.884 --> 00:13:26.465
That's the rise time from §1.1.

