517
00:26:03.614 --> 00:26:04.723
Failure mode.

518
00:26:05.003 --> 00:26:05.835
Interview:

519
00:26:06.115 --> 00:26:09.657
Precision theatre (computing 83.33 per second).

520
00:26:09.937 --> 00:26:10.811
