521
00:26:11.091 --> 00:26:13.459
Estimating once and never validating.

522
00:26:14.809 --> 00:26:15.919
Interview script:

523
00:26:16.199 --> 00:26:24.497
Let me assume 2 M DAU and about 40 API calls each, so 80 M a day, which is about 1 K per second average.

524
00:26:24.777 --> 00:26:28.383
Evening peak is maybe 5 times, so 5 K per second.

