772
00:39:39.215 --> 00:39:50.778
For any scheduled event with a forecast peak above 3 times normal, pre-scale with a cron-based floor sized at P90 times AZ headroom, starting 30 minutes before the event.

773
00:39:51.058 --> 00:39:54.087
Reactive autoscaling stays active above the floor.

774
00:39:54.367 --> 00:39:58.058
Gateway load shedding is mandatory beyond the stress scenario.

